# This directory keeps its own memory and its own session identity.
#
# Placed 2026-09-21 for SWD-98. Without this file the directory is
# addressed by the repository it belongs to, which is how 366 notes across
# eleven directories became unreachable on 2026-08-31. The file's contents are
# never read - its presence is the whole signal - but it is not left empty, so
# that whoever finds it understands it without having to go looking.
#
# Removing this file re-addresses this directory and its memory stops being
# found. Do not delete it casually.
